+## Frontend (apps/web)
+
+Run from `apps/web`:
+
+```text
+pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
+pnpm dev          # Next.js on http://127.0.0.1:3000
+pnpm typecheck
+pnpm lint
+pnpm test         # Vitest, jsdom, React Testing Library, MSW
+pnpm build
+pnpm test:e2e     # Playwright (browsers: pnpm exec playwright install chromium)
+```
+
+The browser calls the API only at the relative path `/api/v1`. In development `next dev` forwards `/api/v1/*` to the API at `http://127.0.0.1:8080` (`API_HOST=127.0.0.1`, `API_PORT=8080`), so the page and the API share one origin and no CORS is involved. The refresh cookie is `Secure`; over local HTTP, start the API with `APP_ENV=development` and `AUTH_COOKIE_SECURE=false` (accepted only in development). The Playwright tests that reach the API run only with `SENTINEL_E2E_API=1` and the API running as above; without it they are skipped and say what they need.
+
 ## CI checks
 
 - Go tests
 - Go vet/lint
 - Frontend typecheck
 - Frontend lint
+- Frontend tests
 - Frontend build
+
+The frontend checks run in `.github/workflows/frontend.yml` (install with `--frozen-lockfile`, typecheck, lint, test, build) on the pinned Node and pnpm.
 - Migration validation
 - Integration tests
